description=TB-J606F (SM6115/WCN3980, Android 11 S320311_230810_ROW). Adds CarIvIBtOverlay (A2DP sink + AVRCP CT + HFP client + auto audio focus), deploys the CarRelay privileged companion app, pins WCN3980 dual-link coexistence props and verifies/patches the bt_a2dp_in audio policy route. Remove this module to undo everything.
